    "title": "Shakshuka",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "instructions": "1. Heat the olive oil in a wide pan over medium heat. Cook the onion and pepper for 8 minutes until soft.\n2. Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute. Pour in the tomatoes, season with salt, and simmer for 10 minutes until thick.\n3. Make four wells in the sauce and crack an egg into each. Cover and cook for 6 to 8 minutes, until the whites are fully set.\n4. Scatter the cilantro over and serve straight from the pan.",
    "servings": 2,
    "tags": [
      "vegetarian"
