    "title": "Spanish omelette",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "instructions": "1. Warm the olive oil in a non-stick pan. Add the potatoes and onion and cook gently for 20 minutes until tender but not browned.\n2. Drain the potatoes and onion, keeping 2 tbsp of the oil. Beat the eggs with the salt and stir in the potatoes and onion.\n3. Heat the reserved oil, pour in the mixture, and cook over low heat for 8 minutes.\n4. Invert onto a plate, slide back into the pan, and cook the other side for 5 minutes, until the centre is set.",
    "servings": 4,
